Subject: [PATCH] Red Dead Redemption (01007820196A6000): profile and note

The NSP script's provisional profile for 1.0.0 (SDK 15.3.2), with render_cond on: without it small black
squares showed in the title scene and the opening cutscene. The shader tables hold 3,583 shaders.

On the Mac, 5 minutes driven with DM_KEYS: language selection, the logo movie, the title, the menus, the
opening train cutscene and gameplay at Armadillo Station, at 30 fps with no [RED] line; the footprint
settles at about 2.5 GB. Not yet tested on an iPhone. The note lists what is open.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#2005
Reason: the Red Dead Redemption profile and note, until upstream has the game. Goes upstream
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#999

